<!-- question: I3_Q1_construcao_matriz_simetrica -->
  <question type="multichoice">
    <name>
      <text>I3_Q1_construcao_matriz_simetrica</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>Seja <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="bold">M</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>5</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>6</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo>]</mo></mrow></math>. Defina, a partir de <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="bold">M</mi></math>, as matrizes <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="bold">S</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="bold">M</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant="bold">M</mi><mi>T</mi></msup></math> e <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="bold">K</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="bold">M</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi mathvariant="bold">M</mi><mi>T</mi></msup></math>. Calcule <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="bold">S</mi></math>, <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="bold">K</mi></math> e suas respectivas transpostas. Qual das afirmações abaixo é <strong>verdadeira</strong>?</p>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <defaultgrade>1.0000000</defaultgrade>
    <penalty>0.3333333</penalty>
    <hidden>0</hidden>
    <single>true</single>
    <shuffleanswers>true</shuffleanswers>
    <answernumbering>abc</answernumbering>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="bold">K</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant="bold">K</mi><mi>T</mi></msup></math>.</p>]]></text>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="100" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="bold">S</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant="bold">S</mi><mi>T</mi></msup></math>.</p>]]></text>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="bold">S</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="bold">M</mi></math>.</p>]]></text>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="bold">K</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="bold">M</mi></math>.</p>]]></text>
    </answer>
  </question>

<!-- question: I3_Q2_produto_matrizes_triangulares -->
  <question type="multichoice">
    <name>
      <text>I3_Q2_produto_matrizes_triangulares</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>Sejam <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="bold">U</mi><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo>]</mo></mrow></math> e <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="bold">U</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>5</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo>]</mo></mrow></math>.</p><p>Calcule o produto <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="bold">U</mi><mn>1</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mi mathvariant="bold">U</mi><mn>2</mn></math> e observe a posição dos elementos nulos e não nulos. Qual das afirmações abaixo é <strong>verdadeira</strong>?</p>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <defaultgrade>1.0000000</defaultgrade>
    <penalty>0.3333333</penalty>
    <hidden>0</hidden>
    <single>true</single>
    <shuffleanswers>true</shuffleanswers>
    <answernumbering>abc</answernumbering>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>O elemento na posição <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math> de <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="bold">U</mi><mn>1</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mi mathvariant="bold">U</mi><mn>2</mn></math> é diferente de zero.</p>]]></text>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="bold">U</mi><mn>1</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mi mathvariant="bold">U</mi><mn>2</mn></math> é uma matriz simétrica.</p>]]></text>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="bold">U</mi><mn>1</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mi mathvariant="bold">U</mi><mn>2</mn></math> é uma matriz triangular inferior (todos os elementos acima da diagonal principal são zero).</p>]]></text>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="100" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>Todos os elementos abaixo da diagonal principal de <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="bold">U</mi><mn>1</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mi mathvariant="bold">U</mi><mn>2</mn></math> são iguais a zero.</p>]]></text>
    </answer>
  </question>

<!-- question: I3_Q3_matriz_rotacao_ortogonal -->
  <question type="multichoice">
    <name>
      <text>I3_Q3_matriz_rotacao_ortogonal</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>Seja <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="bold">R</mi></math> a matriz de rotação com <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math>. Calcule <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><msup><mi mathvariant="bold">R</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><mi mathvariant="bold">R</mi></math>, <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="bold">R</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mi mathvariant="bold">R</mi></math> e <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi>det</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant="bold">R</mi><mo>)</mo></math>. Qual das afirmações abaixo é <strong>verdadeira</strong>?</p>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <defaultgrade>1.0000000</defaultgrade>
    <penalty>0.3333333</penalty>
    <hidden>0</hidden>
    <single>true</single>
    <shuffleanswers>true</shuffleanswers>
    <answernumbering>abc</answernumbering>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="bold">R</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mi mathvariant="bold">R</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="bold">I</mi></math>.</p>]]></text>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi>det</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant="bold">R</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>.</p>]]></text>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="100" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><msup><mi mathvariant="bold">R</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><mi mathvariant="bold">R</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="bold">I</mi></math>.</p>]]></text>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><msup><mi mathvariant="bold">R</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="bold">R</mi></math>.</p>]]></text>
    </answer>
  </question>

<!-- question: I3_Q4_determinante_matriz_triangular -->
  <question type="multichoice">
    <name>
      <text>I3_Q4_determinante_matriz_triangular</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>Seja <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="bold">T</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>5</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo>]</mo></mrow></math>. Calcule <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi>det</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant="bold">T</mi><mo>)</mo></math> e compare com outras combinações dos elementos da diagonal principal de <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="bold">T</mi></math>. Qual das afirmações abaixo é <strong>verdadeira</strong>?</p>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <defaultgrade>1.0000000</defaultgrade>
    <penalty>0.3333333</penalty>
    <hidden>0</hidden>
    <single>true</single>
    <shuffleanswers>true</shuffleanswers>
    <answernumbering>abc</answernumbering>
    <answer fraction="100" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi>det</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant="bold">T</mi><mo>)</mo></math> é igual ao produto dos elementos da diagonal principal de <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="bold">T</mi></math>.</p>]]></text>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi>det</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant="bold">T</mi><mo>)</mo></math> é igual à soma dos elementos da diagonal principal de <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="bold">T</mi></math>.</p>]]></text>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi>det</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant="bold">T</mi><mo>)</mo></math> é igual ao produto de todos os elementos não nulos de <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="bold">T</mi></math>.</p>]]></text>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi>det</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant="bold">T</mi><mo>)</mo></math> é igual ao produto dos elementos da diagonal principal de <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="bold">T</mi></math>, trocado de sinal.</p>]]></text>
    </answer>
  </question>

<!-- question: I3_Q5_vandermonde_valores_repetidos -->
  <question type="multichoice">
    <name>
      <text>I3_Q5_vandermonde_valores_repetidos</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>Construa a matriz de Vandermonde <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="bold">M</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo>[</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>]</mo></mrow><mi>T</mi></msup></math> (como no notebook) para dois casos: <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>)</mo></math> e <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>)</mo></math>. Calcule o determinante de <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="bold">M</mi></math> em cada caso. Qual das afirmações abaixo é <strong>verdadeira</strong>?</p>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <defaultgrade>1.0000000</defaultgrade>
    <penalty>0.3333333</penalty>
    <hidden>0</hidden>
    <single>true</single>
    <shuffleanswers>true</shuffleanswers>
    <answernumbering>abc</answernumbering>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>Em ambos os casos, <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>)</mo></math> e <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>)</mo></math>, a matriz é singular.</p>]]></text>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>Em ambos os casos, a matriz não é singular (determinante diferente de zero).</p>]]></text>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>Para <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>)</mo></math>, a matriz não é singular; para <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>)</mo></math>, a matriz é singular.</p>]]></text>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="100" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>Para <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>)</mo></math>, a matriz é singular (determinante igual a zero); para <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>)</mo></math>, a matriz não é singular.</p>]]></text>
    </answer>
  </question>

